1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,502
Gue cuma ganti satu baris.

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,260
Terus?

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,536
Yang error malah nambah.

4
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:09,625
Coba, sini gue lihat.

5
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:13,753
Udah dari tadi. Besok pagi dikumpulin.

6
00:00:13,753 --> 00:00:16,368
Lo udah cek bagian ini?

7
00:00:16,368 --> 00:00:19,615
Udah. Kayaknya.

8
00:00:19,615 --> 00:00:21,959
Kayaknya gimana?

9
00:00:21,959 --> 00:00:24,507
Gue udah nggak yakin sama apa-apa.

10
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:29,085
Ya udah. Coba tanya Jokoding aja.

11
00:00:29,085 --> 00:00:31,272
Yang bantu koding itu?

12
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:35,805
Iya. Kirim dulu tugas sama errornya.

13
00:00:35,805 --> 00:00:40,700
Sama deadline-nya, kan? Oke, gue chat.

14
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:44,150
Tanyain juga bagian yang lo belum ngerti.

15
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:47,849
Iya. Biar besok nggak bengong.

16
00:00:47,849 --> 00:00:51,773
Nah. Sekarang minum dulu.

17
00:00:51,773 --> 00:00:54,546
Lah, kopi gue udah dingin.

18
00:00:54,546 --> 00:00:57,500
Ya udah, bikin lagi.
